,3794136,11644098,5419479,3404841,3843845,3115380,1520891,3440408,9490677,4634635,8841439,7116779,16743679,67323634,13476798,4938856,8343904,10208790,15043715,14730476,5729641,34941835,61026444,35065758,13847542,7938208,8219164,5726057,95678002,579816153,662699804,237461745,123504705,39694145,36786013,25270551,52395331,19113578,24685888,18805465,56602647,41908965,9145045,3465623,5669476,8482689,1178438,1962051,2623176,3550288,2210817,822149,1800818,1720559,7947539,3166938,5311341,2074285,1068970,1320607,580762,1429666,2476191,2708045,2684470,3135675,1845508,2857595,2886087,4078778,5996451,7870868,12026116,3931278,4124493,1013618,783712,889051,2295600,834600,948400,590700,2152000,1395400,1807700,1699700,1502700,2616500,8736500,3571800,1475000,959100,1170100,1570100,627400,698000,1148300,3941000,2233200,544300,1140300,2320000]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.tiongnam.com","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","employees":1592,"city":"Johor Bahru","summary":"Tiong Nam Logistics Holdings Berhad, an investment holding company, trades in diesel and petrol in Malaysia. It operates through Logistics and Warehousing Services, Investment, Property development, and Dormitory segments. The company provides container haulage; cross-border and heavy transportation services; trucking and crane services; integrated logistics services; logistics solutions comprising comprehensive warehouse facilities and management; and trucking services, including general, cross-border, and heavy haulage, as well as air and sea freight forwarding, and last-mile delivery for e-commerce. It also offers warehousing, property investment, property development, courier transport, transportation, hostel management, and related services, as well as public bonded warehousing and distribution services. In addition, the company engages in leasing of trucks; administrative and commission agency activities; trading and distributing of food groceries; storage and management of empty containers; and acts as general sales agent for air, land, and sea logistics activities. Further, it develops industrial parks, commercial properties, and residential townships; sells canvas; purchases tyres and accessories; repairs and maintains lorries that include smash repairs; and rents warehouses and showrooms, offices, and service centres. The company serves domestic and multinational corporations in sectors, including fast-moving consumer goods, technology, electrical and electronics, automotive, logistics and transportation, and domestic appliances. Tiong Nam Logistics Holdings Berhad was founded in 1975 and is headquartered in Johor Bahru, Malaysia.","zh":"Tiong Nam Logistics Holdings Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，成立于1975年，总部位于马来西亚新山。公司在马来西亚交易柴油和汽油，并通过物流与仓储服务、投资、房地产开发和宿舍等业务板块运营。","lines":["物流与运输服务：提供集装箱拖运、跨境和重型运输、卡车运输和起重机服务，客户包括国内和跨国公司。","综合物流解决方案：提供全面的仓储设施和管理、空运和海运货运代理、以及电子商务的最后一公里配送。","仓储与配送服务：提供公共保税仓储和配送服务，以及空集装箱的存储和管理。","房地产开发：开发工业园区、商业地产和住宅区。","其他辅助业务：包括卡车租赁、食品杂货贸易和分销、轮胎和配件采购、卡车维修和保养、以及仓库和展厅租赁等。"],"lines_en":["Logistics and Transportation Services: Provide container haulage, cross-border and heavy transportation, trucking and crane services to domestic and multinational corporations.","Integrated Logistics Solutions: Offer comprehensive warehouse facilities and management, air and sea freight forwarding, and last-mile delivery for e-commerce.","Warehousing and Distribution Services: Provide public bonded warehousing and distribution services, and storage and management of empty containers.","Property Development: Develop industrial parks, commercial properties, and residential townships.","Other Supporting Services: Include truck leasing, trading and distribution of food groceries, purchasing tyres and accessories, repair and maintenance of lorries, and rental of warehouses and showrooms."]}}